Command-line client for the {{project-name}} service

Usage: {{project-name}} [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  items   Create, read, list and delete items
  doctor  Check server reachability and print this worktree's harness state as JSON
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --server-url <URL>
          Server base URL [default: .harness/app.json, then $APP_URL]

      --output <OUTPUT>
          Output format [default: text on a terminal, json otherwise]

          Possible values:
          - json: One JSON document
          - text: Human-readable lines

  -v, --verbose...
          More logging: -v debug, -vv trace (overrides RUST_LOG)

  -q, --quiet...
          Less logging: -q errors only, -qq nothing (overrides RUST_LOG)

      --otel
          Export this run's spans and logs over OTLP (off by default)

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')

  -V, --version
          Print version
